-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mcomplete}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{mComplete}(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal E\\ [B\\le_m A].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mcomplete}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{mComplete}(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal E\\ [B\\le_m A].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 属于 c.e. 的条件纳入定义，防止对任意非 c.e. 集合误用本书的 completeness。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.4.1；印刷页 38；PDF 第 74 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mcomplete}\\vda